stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Menu
  Menu --> Loading: start
  Loading --> Running: ready
  Loading --> Suspended: blocked
  Running --> Paused: pause
  Running --> Suspended: blocked
  Paused --> Running: resume
  Suspended --> Running: ready
  Running --> GameOver: hazard
  GameOver --> Loading: restart
  Paused --> Loading: restart
  Suspended --> Loading: restart
  GameOver --> Menu: exit
  Paused --> Menu: exit
  Suspended --> Menu: exit
  note right of Paused
    Manual resume only when
    visible and terrain ready
    Simulation and active timing stop
    Interruption flag is retained
  end note
  note right of Suspended
    Hidden tab, missing terrain
    or build/storage failure
    Resume when visible and ready
    Simulation, rings, effects
    and active timing freeze
    Storage retry preserves flags
    Restart creates a new runId
    with an empty attempt journal
  end note
